# CODEOWNERS — human review gates (the REAL enforcement for CP-1 / ADR-0009).
#
# Branch protection must be enabled on the default branch with
# "Require review from Code Owners" for this file to have real effect.
# A local script (approve_master_context.py) cannot gate the agent that
# runs it; only forge-side required review can. See docs/architecture/ADR-0009.

# --- Highest sensitivity: human-gated master context + its lock (CP-1) ---
/.ai/control/MASTER_CONTEXT.md        @lowelltwong-alt
/.ai/control/MASTER_CONTEXT.lock.yaml @lowelltwong-alt

# --- Model routing policy + roster (capability profiles + provider allowlist) ---
/config/agents/                       @lowelltwong-alt
